</section>24:T5d7,<section class="product-description" aria-label="Red Dead Redemption 2 New Steam Account">

  <h2>🎮 <strong>Red Dead Redemption 2</strong> – <em>New Steam Private Account (PC)</em></h2>

  <p>
    Get a brand-new <strong>private Steam account</strong> with
    <strong>Red Dead Redemption 2</strong> already activated.
    Enjoy full access to Story Mode and Red Dead Online with
    permanent access on a dedicated account. 🤠🔥
  </p>

  <hr />

  <h3>⭐ <strong>Product Details:</strong></h3>
  <ul>
    <li>💻 <strong>Platform:</strong> PC (Steam)</li>
    <li>🔐 <strong>Account Type:</strong> New Steam Private Account</li>
    <li>🕹️ <strong>Access:</strong> Full Story Mode + Online Multiplayer</li>
    <li>📥 Steam login details provided after purchase</li>
    <li>🔒 Private account — not shared with anyone</li>
    <li>📌 One-time payment with permanent access</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>📦 What You Will Receive:</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>🔑 Brand-new Steam account</li>
    <li>🎮 Red Dead Redemption 2 pre-activated</li>
    <li>🌍 Access to Red Dead Online</li>
    <li>👤 Full login credentials after delivery</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Experience one of the greatest open-world adventures ever created —
    explore vast landscapes, follow an emotional story,
